<title>UK: Entire July Statfjord programme delayed two days.</title>
<headline>Entire July Statfjord programme delayed two days.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>All 30 cargoes in the July loading programme for Norway's Statfjord crude will be delayed by two days because of a problem at a production platform, trade sources said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>The delay will also hit &quot;more than one&quot; of the standard 855,000 barrel cargoes still to load before the end of June, the sources added.</p>
<p>No cargoes have been cut from the programme, though two end-July loadings will now overspill into August.</p>
<p>&quot;Its because of a problem at the Statfjord B platform,&quot; the trade source said.</p>
<p>-- London newsroom +44 171 542 8060</p>
